sequenceDiagram
    title Variant B - flight search after car selection, on the SRP
    participant User
    participant SearchWidget
    participant SRP
    participant AddFlightSheet
    participant FlightStore
    participant SaleStore
    participant SessionStorage
    participant GuestPage
    participant BFF

    User->>SearchWidget: pickup, destination, date, time, pax
    SearchWidget->>BFF: search async without flightNumber
    BFF-->>SRP: vehicle results
    User->>SRP: taps a VehicleCard
    SRP->>SaleStore: createSale sId and optionId
    SaleStore->>BFF: POST sale
    BFF-->>SRP: saleId
    SRP->>AddFlightSheet: open instead of navigating
    AddFlightSheet-->>User: add your flight for terminal and tracking
    User->>AddFlightSheet: types a flight number or airline
    AddFlightSheet->>FlightStore: useFlightSearch debounced fetch
    FlightStore->>BFF: GET flight query and departuredate
    BFF-->>FlightStore: airlines or segments
    FlightStore-->>AddFlightSheet: viewState carriers or results
    User->>AddFlightSheet: selects a flight segment
    AddFlightSheet->>SessionStorage: saveFlightSession selectedFlight
    AddFlightSheet->>SaleStore: updateSaleInfo with flight details
    SaleStore->>BFF: PATCH contact-additional-info
    BFF-->>SaleStore: sale with flightDetails and terminal
    AddFlightSheet-->>GuestPage: hard navigate to guest saleId
    GuestPage->>SessionStorage: loadFlightSession
    SessionStorage-->>GuestPage: selectedFlight
    GuestPage-->>User: FlightInfoCard rendered in the summary
